    "Black Box Insurance",
    "Black box insurance – also called telematics – is a type of car insurance where a small device is fitted in your car which measures how well and when you drive.",
    "This means if you’re a safe driver, we’ll reward you with discounted insurance at renewal. It’s that easy.",
    "Our black box product is called LittleBox, but we actually offer three different types of LittleBox insurance.",
    "We decide which type of LittleBox you'll get based on a few risk factors, such as the type of vehicle you drive or how long you've held your license. You can't choose which type of black box you get.",
    "Our original LittleBox is a product that's installed in your vehicle and will need to be fitted by one of our engineers.",
    "Plug and Drive is a small unit that fits into the 12V socket in your car. It doesn't need to be fitted by an engineer - you can just plug it in yourself and you're ready to go.",
    "LittleBox Pod is a small Bluetooth device that's fitted to your windscreen. With this option, you'll have access to an app that gives you updates on your driving.",
    "Check out what benefits our fully comprehensive LittleBox insurance includes.",
    "If you’re not sure what some of our car insurance terms mean, check out our car insurance jargon buster.",
    "Once you’ve purchased your LittleBox policy you can start driving as soon as your policy starts, you don’t need to wait for LittleBox to be fitted to your car.",
    "Our engineers will fit your LittleBox within 30 days. If you have one of our self-install products, you’ll need to make sure it’s fitted within 15 days.",
    "See how safe a driver you are and get tips on how you can improve your driving score.",
    "The good news is safe drivers get a discount when it comes to renewal!",
    "Sharing your driving data with us means we can price your cover fairly and accurately, based on how safely you drive.",
    "The telematics technology monitors how and when you drive along with lots of other risk factors to help calculate your driving score. Get a good driving score and you could get a cheaper insurance price at renewal.",
    "You can drive anytime you like with LittleBox, but late-night driving (10pm-4am) will reduce your overall driving score. So, if you need to drive your car overnight, it may not be the best option for you.",
    "It's important to remember that if you're driving extremely unsafely and consistently have a poor score, we could cancel your policy.",
    "If you drive safely, you're more likely to get a discount when it's time to renew.",
    "You'll be able to see how good a driver you are and get tips on how you can improve your driving score.",
    "If your car’s stolen when LittleBox is active, call our Claims team with your crime reference number and we’ll speak to the police to help give you the best chance possible of getting your car back. Theft tracking isn’t available on LittleBox Plug&Drive or LittleBox Pod, but let us know anyway and we’ll see what we can do.",
    "Not all black box policies are the same - find out how LittleBox is different as we break some common myths around curfews, monitoring and data.",
    "See our list of the cheapest cars to insure for drivers from the ages of 17-25.",
    "Everything you need to know about telematics insurance",
